{"title":"할리 퀸","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=1OtYW/hAd4AZTNWO/lyInG2AE2CHGf7pCJncsu0&filename=th3","synopsis":"우리가 사랑하는 할리 퀸의 광기가 팡팡 터지는 우주 활극!\n\n\n여름 휴가를 즐기던 할리 퀸 앞에,\n다크사이드가 지배하는 행성 아포콜립스의 여전사 집단 피메일 퓨리즈가 나타나 그녀를 납치한다.\n\n퓨리즈의 수장 그래니 굿니스가 거절할 수 없는 달콤한 제안을 하고,\n할리 퀸은 그 제안을 수락하면서 엄청난 힘을 갖게 된다.\n\n하지만 세상에 공짜는 없는 법!\n\n힘을 얻은 대가로 마음이 불편해지는 임무를 수행해야만 하는데...\nDC 여캐 빌런 원탑 할리 퀸 팬이라면 결코 놓쳐선 안 되는 작품!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":173,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":249,"change":{"type":"down","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":262,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":153,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":244,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":164,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":136,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":117,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":107,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":113,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":128,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":209,"change":{"type":"down","amount":81}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":191,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-09-24","rank":155,"change":{"type":"up","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":107,"change":{"type":"up","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":122,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":107,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":136,"change":{"type":"down","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":147,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":207,"change":{"type